{"id":"t1138476","key":"riba nagarenaide yo|2023","csv":{"title":"Ribâ nagarenaide yo","year":2023,"directors":["Junta Yamaguchi"],"rating":7,"watchedDate":"2026-01-12"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":1138476,"imdbId":"tt27695005","wikidataId":"Q123420912","title":"En boucle","originalTitle":"リバー、流れないでよ","altTitles":["Ribâ, nagarenaide yo","リバー、流れないでよ","River","리버, 흐르지 말아줘"],"tagline":"Ils ne sont pas sortis de l'auberge !","overview":"Une nouvelle journée commence à l’auberge Fujiya, nichée au cœur des montagnes japonaises. Une journée ordinaire… ou presque : car les uns après les autres, les employés et les clients se rendent compte que les mêmes 2 minutes sont en train de se répéter à l’infini… Certains veulent en sortir, d’autres préfèrent y rester, mais tous cherchent à comprendre ce qui leur arrive.","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"2023-06-23","runtime":86,"status":"Released","genres":["Comédie","Science-Fiction","Fantastique"],"genreIds":[35,878,14],"countries":["Japan"],"originCountry":["JP"],"languages":["日本語"],"originalLanguage":"ja","directors":["山口淳太"],"directorIds":[3008307],"writers":["上田誠"],"composers":["Koji Takimoto"],"cinematographers":["川越一成"],"editors":["山口淳太"],"producers":["Takahiro Otsuki"],"cast":[{"id":2804365,"name":"藤谷理子","character":"Mikoto","profilePath":"/ujpigApXRsEp21hULUagkvsKWyY.jpg"},{"id":2811889,"name":"鳥越裕貴","character":"Taku","profilePath":"/x3E1RxPg9nxKElS2fntK79D6mMO.jpg"},{"id":124958,"name":"永野宗典","character":"Head Clerk","profilePath":"/4SYOW0lZTd3cNvNLmct4TfQSE88.jpg"},{"id":3009495,"name":"角田貴志","character":"Head Chef","profilePath":null},{"id":1301880,"name":"諏訪雅","character":"Nomiya","profilePath":"/2AOA8aQVIONIoZZm64FM43Twdk6.jpg"},{"id":2523975,"name":"石田剛太","character":"Kusumi","profilePath":"/l45dUW3p92TyisWlqRs2rYwRS6I.jpg"},{"id":1777999,"name":"中川晴樹","character":"Sugiyama","profilePath":null},{"id":1998971,"name":"土佐和成","character":"Hunter","profilePath":"/pjmEpy5LN9DIX6Z580Ol59kUc0e.jpg"},{"id":2247093,"name"